10. The report records limitations including possible model backend changes, lack of seed/temperature control, and that three runs do not provide statistical significance. (Fact 35)

Relationship notes: The sequence records the chronological order of events as supported by the source. The relationship between the candidate prompt change (step 3) and the observed score/positioning changes (step 6-7) is UNKNOWN in causal terms because the source does not explicitly prove causality. (See Unknowns 1 and 3.)


